{"4485070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cloudsphere", "steam_appid": 4485070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5180760], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/5068c1b95228d014d94fe616f874b76e.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every module you install changes both your ship and your deck. Add weapons to unleash new attacks, defensive systems to protect your vessel, or utility modules to manipulate the battlefield. Each module comes with a Captain's Order - a card to play in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your vessel block by block, then decide which parts to activate and when. Your deck isn't a collection of cards, it's your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/44e0fddb05d1d9f161778bbbc01fac5f.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies are full of opportunities, but the best route isn't always the one laid out in front of you. Spend resources to reveal more of the map, reshape the paths ahead, and seek out the encounters and opportunities your build needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops, upgrades, overclocks, cargo stops, and dangerous encounters all compete for your attention and your resources. Plan ahead, adapt to what you uncover, and make every stop count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/e6a934dfaa116972e6b12671a3eb6817.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run lets you push further into the skies. Spend what you've earned to unlock new abilities, expand your options, and open up new ways to approach each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you explore, the more the world opens up, giving you new features, new tools, and new ways to build your perfect vessel.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/5068c1b95228d014d94fe616f874b76e.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/60c7f9072d3472743564817242b964d9.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every module you install changes both your ship and your deck. Add weapons to unleash new attacks, defensive systems to protect your vessel, or utility modules to manipulate the battlefield. Each module comes with a Captain's Order - a card to play in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your vessel block by block, then decide which parts to activate and when. Your deck isn't a collection of cards, it's your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/44e0fddb05d1d9f161778bbbc01fac5f.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/3d5ee7144b3c60ae3ca3b6e77afea79a.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The skies are full of opportunities, but the best route isn't always the one laid out in front of you. Spend resources to reveal more of the map, reshape the paths ahead, and seek out the encounters and opportunities your build needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shops, upgrades, overclocks, cargo stops, and dangerous encounters all compete for your attention and your resources. Plan ahead, adapt to what you uncover, and make every stop count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/e6a934dfaa116972e6b12671a3eb6817.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1500 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.poster.avif?t=1788166384\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.webm?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/extras/22fc55f16db994e131d0ec59d90c9875.mp4?t=1788166384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run lets you push further into the skies. Spend what you've earned to unlock new abilities, expand your options, and open up new ways to approach each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you explore, the more the world opens up, giving you new features, new tools, and new ways to build your perfect vessel.</p>", "short_description": "A roguelike deckbuilder where your ship is your deck. Build modular sky-vessels block by block - every module adds a card to your deck! Chase outrageous builds, push overclocks to the limit, conquer the cloud world, and take revenge on the leviathan that destroyed your home.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/f9f53a7f5e18c5b071966ef2ddcdb22e0783ee99/header.jpg?t=1788166384", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/9f6cd1d22a3e38af32a57968ae6e2249b866bef1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788166384", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4485070/9f6cd1d22a3e38af32a57968ae6e2249b866bef1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788166384", "website": "https://www.lakistudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_